 gateway → Authorino → Limitador → payload-processing → backend (per Staff Engineer Input guidance embedded in the strategy).\n\n## Assumptions\n\n- An OpenTelemetry collector is available or provisable on CKS (flagged in the CKS observability infrastructure validation).\n- Tracing configuration for Authorino/Limitador depends on the Kuadrant deployment mechanism selected by the RHCL xKS support investigation.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":73782,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-87fd07bf831150f8","agent_id":"a20fa1aa5b3a9ab51","session_id":"b158df32-2239-4f0e-abf0-6598f1f60a7a","uuid":"65c3288c-630e-45c9-8599-9521defb419d","timestamp":"2026-10-22T10:34:19.750Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8003 into epics"}
